activity Submit Timesheet
activity Approve Timesheet
activity Calculate Gross Pay
activity Calculate Deductions
activity Calculate Net Pay
activity Process Payment
activity Update Payroll Records
activity Review Payroll Report
activity Distribute Paystub
bind Submit Timesheet: Employee ID, Hours Worked, Timesheet Status
bind Approve Timesheet: Employee ID, Timesheet Status
bind Calculate Gross Pay: Hours Worked, Pay Rate, Gross Pay
bind Calculate Deductions: Gross Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction
bind Calculate Net Pay: Gross Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction, Net Pay
bind Process Payment: Employee ID, Net Pay, Payment Method
bind Update Payroll Records: 
bind Review Payroll Report: 
bind Distribute Paystub: 
Employee ID: integer between 0 and 999999
Hours Worked: integer between 0 and 80
Timesheet Status: Submitted, Approved, Rejected
Pay Rate: float between 10.0 and 100.0
Gross Pay: float between None and None
Tax Deduction: float between None and None
Insurance Deduction: float between None and None
Net Pay: float between None and None
Payment Method: Direct Deposit, Check
Init[Submit Timesheet] | |
Succession[Submit Timesheet, Approve Timesheet] | | |
Succession[Approve Timesheet, Calculate Gross Pay] | | |
Succession[Calculate Gross Pay, Calculate Deductions] | | |
Succession[Calculate Deductions, Calculate Net Pay] | | |
Succession[Calculate Net Pay, Process Payment] | | |
Succession[Process Payment, Update Payroll Records] | | |
Succession[Update Payroll Records, Review Payroll Report] | | |
Succession[Review Payroll Report, Distribute Paystub] | | |
Not Succession[Approve Timesheet, Submit Timesheet] | | |
Succession[Process Payment, Distribute Paystub] | | |0,24,h